    {
      "id": "claim_79bd6ee783554b7fbcc2a3375dc388c4",
      "statement": "wire_corridor_stats_daily carries no suppression flag despite being built across all originating clients, and the catalog's own rolling-90-day corridor sample includes thin corridors (e.g. MXN/MX with 88 distinct clients and a 21% largest-client share, NGN/NG with 11 clients and a 38% largest-client share) that would fail DUS-07's aggregated cohort-disclosure thresholds (>=500 transactions, >=20 distinct clients, no client over 15% of volume) if shown to clients.",
