      "id": "claim_44e673bb6adb4bfaa61713f15fc97d3c",
      "statement": "Onboarding a new Insights API endpoint requires four sequential steps: MRM inventory registration per MRM-POL-02, data-access approvals per DUS-07, serving-endpoint build (typically ~13-21 story points), and Disclosure Review Committee approval of client-facing wording and disclaimers.",
      "evidence": [
