    {
      "id": "claim_00cbffff03364ec0b05e84f050f83421",
      "statement": "As of this catalog extract, TDIP has three known operational gaps: Fed acceptance timestamps are not ingested (TDA-2210), gpi data refreshes only nightly until TDA-2188 completes (targeted 2026-11, history starting 2025-03-01), and no sub-minute real-time serving exists for wire data (hourly is the minimum achievable freshness).",
